The HCF of two numbers is 12 and their LCM is 180. If one of the numbers is 36, what is the other number?

A) 48
B) 54
C) 60
D) 72

Answer: C) 60

Explanation:

For two numbers:

$$ \text{HCF} \times \text{LCM} = \text{Product of the two numbers} $$

So,

$$ 12\times180=36\times x $$ $$ 2160=36x $$
x=
36
2160
	​

=
60
	​
